THIRD-PARTY DATA NOTICE

The MIT license above covers the source code, scripts, configuration and
documentation in this repository. It does NOT relicense third-party data.

Pretraining corpus
  Derived from HuggingFaceTB/smollm-corpus (`cosmopedia-v2`,
  `fineweb-edu-dedup`). Subject to that dataset's own terms. Only tokenized
  shards were produced locally; the shards themselves are not distributed in
  this repository (see README §14).

Evaluation benchmarks
  GSM8K (OpenAI), SVAMP, and AQuA-RAT are used under their respective
  licenses. Derived files under `data/reasoning/` and
  `data/gsm8k_compact_reasoning/` are transformations of GSM8K and remain
  subject to its terms.

Synthetic data
  `data/replay_arithmetic/`, `data/progressive_subtraction_sft/`,
  `data/arithmetic_sft/`, `data/subtraction_sft/`,
  `data/mixed_subtraction_sft/` and the E1-E7 evaluation suites are generated
  deterministically by scripts in this repository and are covered by the MIT
  license above.

Model weights
  Checkpoints distributed via GitHub Releases are released under the MIT
  license. They are research artifacts and are NOT fit for production use;
  see README §15 (Limitations) and reports/Mini-R1_model_card.md.
